=== omp.ts
- * omp extension: runs tsc on the project when the main agent is about to
- * stop. On errors it asks omp for one more turn with the errors as context,
- * so the model fixes them. Loaded through `extensions` in the omp config, in
- * place of ./pi.ts.
+ * omp extension: runs pyrefly on the project when the main agent is about
