+ * config, in place of ./pi.ts.
=== pi.ts
- * pi extension: runs tsc on the project when a run ends. On errors it sends
- * them to the model as a follow-up message that starts one more run, so the
- * model fixes them. The end of that run passes without a check: pi has no
- * `stop_hook_active`, so this flag is the loop guard. Loaded through the
- * `extensions` setting of pi. omp loads ./omp.ts instead.
